00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.019
because it's using some of the ray tracing architecture

292
00:13:39.019 --> 00:13:43.080
to be able to give us our dynamic global illumination

293
00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:48.240
and believable lights within our scene in real time.

